  "method": "The Shootings dataset (5ucz-vwe8) now has one row per shooting incident, not per victim (its description says it 'identifies every shooting incident'). Victims are in the companion Shooting Victims dataset (pztn-9bne), which has no date, so each victim was joined to its incident on INCIDENT_KEY and counted by the year of the incident's OCCUR_DATE. Rows repeating the same VICTIM_ID were counted once. Borough is the incident's borough.",
